<title>USA: Burlington Coat Factory expands repurchase.</title>
<headline>Burlington Coat Factory expands repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.J. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Coat Factory Warehouse Corp on Tuesday said it was expanding its stock repurchase program by $5 million.</p>
<p>Burlington Coat Factory said the program, which began in October, would continue through January 10, 1999.</p>
<p>The company said it already repurchased 653,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
